# Least-privilege Redis ACL rules for the risk service (Redis 7+).
# Grants exactly the commands the service sends, on its own keys only.
# CI creates a user from this file and runs the real-Redis tests as that user.
#
#   ACL SETUSER risk-service on >STRONG-PASSWORD <the rules line below>
#
~risk:* resetchannels -@all +ping +select +client|setinfo +hget +hset +hdel +hgetall +hmget +exists +del +zadd +zcard +zremrangebyscore +pexpire +watch +unwatch +multi +exec +discard
